        "alternate_id_field_name.descr": "The name of the alternate ID field on the edge feature sources of the network dataset. All edge feature sources referenced by turns must have the same name for the alternate ID field.",
        "alternate_id_field_name.title": "Alternate ID Field Name",
        "description": "Creates and populates additional fields on the turn feature classes that reference the edges in the network  by alternate IDs. The alternate IDs help maintain the integrity of the turn features if the edge sources are edited in such a way that their ObjectID values change.",
